<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s202S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w1">ngag <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s202m1">rtsub po</span></span>&#x27;i ni, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w2">sa phyogs</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w3">sdong dum</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w4">tsher ma</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w5">rdo</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w6">gseg ma</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w7">gyo mo</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w8">mang ba</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w9">rtsub pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s202q1">mdangs mi snum pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w10">&#x27;bab chu</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w11">mtsho</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w12">lteng ka</span> med pa dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w13">skams</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w14">tshva</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w15">rgo</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w16">dgon dung</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w17">tha chad</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w18">sdig pa can</span> gyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w19">sa gzhi</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s202q2">&#x27;jigs pa&#x27;i rgyu mang po dang ldan pa</span> dang</span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s202S">Because you have spoken <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w1"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s202m1">harsh</span> words</span>, the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w2">ground</span> where you live is covered with obstacles like the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w3">trunks of fallen trees</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w4">thorns</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w5">stones</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w6">clods of dirt</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w8">lots</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w7">sharp broken pieces of glass</span>; it&#x27;s <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w9">rough</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s202q1">dreary</span>; no <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w10">streams</span>, or <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w11">lakes</span>, or <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w12">springs of water</span>; the whole <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w19">earth</span> is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w13">parched</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w15">poisoned</span> with <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w14">salt</span> and borax, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w16">burning hot</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w17">useless</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s202w18">threatening</span>; a place where there are <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s202q2">many things to fear</span>.</span>
</div>
